th with the SDK's (who owns the RX DMA buffer after le_hci acl delivery: the stock host frees it in btstack_task; check our shim does not also free/recycle it); (3) check RX DMA buffer size vs config_btctler_le_acl_packet_length 27 / le_rx_nums 5 against the SDK's defaults (an RX longer than the slot would overwrite the next header). Stress test not run (connect fails). |
